{"unit_id": "Tyan66666__billion-context-dsh#card-zh", "repo": "Tyan66666/billion-context-dsh", "commit": "3b893134452810909f2b31fe1643b7c70cf77ea4", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "billion-context-dsh 为 DeepSeek Harness 提供 Active Context Pruning 引擎，让模型通过 compress 工具决定何时压缩以及保留哪些历史细节，而非按固定上限截断。压缩结果形成 checkpoint，原始会话日志保留；decompress 可恢复内容，search_context 可在历史块中检索，acp_status 与 /acp-prune 提供状态查看。它适合长会话和长任务中需要精简上下文、保留可恢复细节的用户；安装后需重启 DSH profile。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["README.md:40-80", "src/index.ts:1-40", "src/commands.ts:1-30"]}
